<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Ba2 to Mexico's 70 bln yen samurai.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Ba2 to Mexico's 70 bln yen samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had assigned its Ba2 rating to Mexico's 70 billion yen worth of samurai bonds due September 30, 2002.</p>
<p>The rating agency gave no further details.</p>
</text>
